Alembic migrations. Run all commands from the backend/ directory.

  alembic upgrade head                                  # apply all migrations
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add posts table"  # after changing models
  alembic downgrade -1                                  # roll back one revision
  alembic stamp head                                    # mark an existing DB as up to date

DATABASE_URL comes from app.core.config (environment / project .env), never alembic.ini.
New models must be imported in app/models/__init__.py so autogenerate can see them.
